OL,3,GNEWSAPensioner charged with murder
OL,4,Aafter woman's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with murder
OL,7,Ffollowing the death of a woman in her
OL,8,F70s.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to an
OL,11,Faddress in Sherbourne Avenue in Bradley
OL,12,FStoke, Bristol, at about 14:00 BST on
OL,13,FFriday after a 71-year-old woman was
OL,14,Ffound with serious injuries and
OL,15,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,17,FGerald Bishop, of Sherbourne Avenue,
OL,18,Fwas arrested and later charged with
OL,19,Fmurder, Avon and Somerset Police said.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
